12) Test delete for newest version with 1 version
13) Test delete for all versions with 1 version
14) Test delete for oldest version with no versions
15) Test delete for newest version with no versions
16) Test delete for all versions with no versions
17) Test view for oldest version with normal numver
18) Test view for newest version with normal numver
