20) Test view for V version > maxver with normal numver
21) Test view for oldest and newest version with 1 version
22) Test view for oldest version with no versions
23) Test view for newest version with no versions
24) Test restore for newest version with normal numver
25) Test restore for V version with normal numver
26) Test retore for oldest version with normal number
27) Test restore for V version > maxver with normal numver
28) Test restore for newest and 1 version with 1 version
29) Test restore for newest version with no versions
30) Test delete newest then restore then delete newest then restore with
normal numver
31) Test mount with invalid string instead of maxver=
32) Test mount with invalid number maxver=12c, etc.
33) Test mount with version<minver
34) Test mount with version>maxver
35) Test call to check file hiding in mnt directory
36) Test call with write of 4096 bytes
(vfs makes call in slots of 4096 hence one bkp)
37) Test call with large file write with open, write and close in loop
(mult ver with diff of 4096)
38) Test call with large file write with open, close and write in loop
(mult ver with diff of 16)
